{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22986","headline":"九日醉吟 · 白居易","name":"九日醉吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有恨头还白，无情菊自黄。\n一爲州司马，三见岁重阳。\n劒匣尘埃满，笼禽日月长。\n身从渔父笑，门任雀罗张。\n问疾因留客，听吟偶置觞。\n叹时论倚伏，怀旧数存亡。\n奈老应无计，治愁或有方。\n无过学王绩，唯以醉爲乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22986.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22986","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}